OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 26 MAY
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GAs part of Miles Davis 100 on
OL,6,     GRadio 3 Sara Mohr-Pietsch
OL,7,     Gpresents an soundtrack inspired
OL,8,     Gby his groundbreaking album 'In A
OL,9,     GSilent Way'.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto Kinch welcomes composer
OL,12,     Gand saxophonist Cassie Kinoshi,
OL,13,     Gto reflect on three albums by
OL,14,     GMiles Davis that have influenced
OL,15,     Gher, on his birthday night.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GKristiina Poska conducts the
OL,18,     GNorwegian Radio Orchestra in
OL,19,     GSibelius' two last symphonies. In
OL,20,     Gbetween, Shostakovich's energetic
OL,21,     GConcerto for Piano and Trumpet.
